💭 The health endpoint: what a probe is told when all is well, when a check fails, and
💭 when the server has been asked to stop.
📗
  A gate that a check waits at until the test opens it. Only the first to
  arrive waits. Whoever comes while it does goes straight through, so that a
  probe which goes into the check when it should not shows as a check asked
  once too often, and not as a test that never ends.
